      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Honestly in my experience it is far worse than this. I've witnessed the VRC_Pickup script take upwards of 8 seconds to realize someone has picked it up remotely. And that 8 second figure is not uncommon, I see it all the time.\nNot 100% sure about this one but it seems to affect desktop users more than VR. Like if a remote desktop player picks something up it can take 8+ seconds, while if a remote VR player picks something up it is usually 1-3 seconds.",
